  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Let the sets <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;denote the domain and range respectively of the function <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mfrac><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;denotes the smallest integer greater than or equal to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>. Then among the statements</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8469;</mi></math>&nbsp;and</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "Only <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;is true",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Only <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;is true",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Neither <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;nor <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is true",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "Both <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;are true",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p>We know that,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is fractional part of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;whose value is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>,</p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Now putting the value in given function we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p>Now we know that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></msqrt></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is defined when&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, but&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></msqrt></math>&nbsp;is not defined</p><p>Hence,&nbsp;Domain and Range will be<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>&#981;</mi></math>&nbsp;</p></blockquote>"
  }
